{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的 S06、S13 感受提示仍然偏密，个别音乐术语如“F小调”“八度”对普通观众不一定能即时转化成听感，容易短暂抢走注意力；Y 的部分生活化表达反而更直白。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 用加亮的叙事锚点让观众迅速抓住每段发生了什么、人物为什么这样想，小字感受又随音乐到点出现，减少了同时处理一大堆词的负担。从最初的解脱、失落，到眷恋、孤单、动摇，再到接受过去、决定继续生活，故事和音乐的情绪变化能够互相印证，细节也更具体。Y 的生活化叙述和部分感受词并不差，但右侧大量短词缺乏重点层级和音乐时点，观众需要自己归类、寻找联系，听音乐时更容易扫成一堆零散标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "89d421ea-2be0-4155-b1d2-653df9d92004", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T075508187655Z", "elapsed_seconds": 92.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:56:40.564294+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d1beb85d3fd27d4e4eb1675a87974cbb3f90a4db46a1edcbe0512c0d5d796246", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc422230